---
// Section Témoignages — placeholder élégant, avis Google à venir
---

<section
  id="temoignages"
  class="py-12 md:py-20 px-4"
  style="background-color:#EDE6D7;"
  aria-labelledby="temoignages-heading"
>
  <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto text-center fade-in-section">

    <!-- Étoiles placeholder -->
    <div class="flex justify-center gap-1 mb-6" aria-hidden="true">
      {[1,2,3,4,5].map(() => (
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" class="w-5 h-5" style="color:var(--color-accent);">
          <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10.788 3.21c.448-1.077 1.976-1.077 2.424 0l2.082 5.007 5.404.433c1.164.093 1.636 1.545.749 2.305l-4.117 3.527 1.257 5.273c.271 1.136-.964 2.033-1.96 1.425L12 18.354 7.373 21.18c-.996.608-2.231-.29-1.96-1.425l1.257-5.273-4.117-3.527c-.887-.76-.415-2.212.749-2.305l5.404-.433 2.082-5.006z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
        </svg>
      ))}
    </div>

    <h2
      id="temoignages-heading"
      class="font-serif font-semibold text-[var(--color-primary)] mb-4"
      style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:clamp(1.5rem,3vw,2rem);"
    >
      Premiers avis bientôt disponibles
    </h2>

    <p class="font-sans text-[var(--color-text)] opacity-70 leading-relaxed text-base mb-8 max-w-lg mx-auto">
      ICAM Conciergerie démarre son activité en 2026. Nous construisons notre réputation réservation après réservation. Vos retours arrivent bientôt.
    </p>

    <a
      href="https://g.page/r/ICAM-conciergerie/review"
      class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 border border-[var(--color-accent)] text-[var(--color-accent)] font-sans font-medium text-sm rounded-sm hover:bg-[var(--color-accent)] hover:text-white transition-colors"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
      aria-label="Laisser un avis Google pour ICAM Conciergerie"
    >
      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
        <path d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm-2 14.5v-9l6 4.5-6 4.5z"/>
      </svg>
      Laisser un avis Google
    </a>

  </div>
</section>
